<title>USA: NYSE closing averages.</title>
<headline>NYSE closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the New York Stock Exchange ended lower in active trading.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones Industrial Average fell 20.47 to 6792.25.</p>
<p>The NYSE Composite fell 1.09 to 403.62.</p>
<p>The average price per share was down $0.11.</p>
<p>Losers beat winners 1244 to 1149.</p>
<p>Volume was 485,418,470 compared with 489,240,330 on Wednesday.</p>
<p>(Prices official as of 1645 EST/2045 GMT).</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730))</p>
